stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received
    Received --> Rejected: malformed
    Received --> Checked: parse
    Checked --> Rejected: any obligation not unsat,<br/>hash mismatch, budget exhausted
    Checked --> Quiescing: admitted
    Quiescing --> Aborted: deadline missed,<br/>affected frame still active
    Quiescing --> Swapped: all tasks parked,<br/>no affected frame on any stack
    Swapped --> RolledBack: fault during migration<br/>(old version kept, heap intact)
    Swapped --> Committed: tasks resume
    Committed --> RolledBack: fault in watch window<br/>(restore snapshot and v1 code)
    Committed --> [*]: watch window closes clean
    Rejected --> [*]
    Aborted --> [*]
    RolledBack --> [*]
